//7.31.26: trying double tap tap dance for layer swaps due to involuntary toggling - included shift / caps tap dance 

// Next implementations:
// Wire in the physical power off switches on both halves
// programming of the OLED screens to house custom designs
// Hold tap implementation for shift and capslock
// custom hold tap for left click on nav for drag functionality. 
// shift acceleration for mouse navigation?
// need to change the num pad , & / designations as I need to use both with the numpad (dates & lists of parts) - 12/17/25
// need to change the toggle layer setup - i'm consistently toggling when I don't want to - this is better, but may be good to further fine tune the timing
// change "+" to be numpad plus to work better with file explorer
// input "insert" key to allow ease of use with smartsheet




